                "description": "Deltana BBS2019 18 Inch Solid Brass Shelf - The contemporary design of the Sobe Series Shelf makes is perfect for modern styled homes. This 18 inch Solid Brass shelf has concealed screw mounting for a sleek look. It is available in oil rubbed bronze, polished chrome, polished nickel and satin nickel finishes.",
